    NewReportPage --> AwsS3 : PUT image
    NewReportPage --> InspectionQueries : saves the SIR
    PresignRoute --> AwsS3 : presigned PUT
    SiteImagesRoute --> AwsS3 : presigned GET
    SiteGalleryRoute --> AwsS3 : presigned GET
    HomepageImagesRoute --> AwsS3 : presigned GET
    ImageDeleteRoute --> SupabaseBackend : W26_attachments, W26_homepage-image-uploads
    ImageDeleteRoute --> AwsS3 : DeleteObject
    PdfRoute --> SupabaseBackend : S26_pdf_jobs
    PdfRoute ..> PdfJobProcessor : after()
